||
||
|-- notes (modified) -- L|
||
cursor 5 0
== a line down, C-y: the three kills, one text
|hello|
|third world|
|second line|
||
||
|-- notes (modified) -- L|
||
cursor 11 2
== three Backspace, one C-d
|hello|
|third world|
|second l|
||
||
|-- notes (modified) -- L|
||
cursor 8 2
== Escape <, C-e, a space, the arrows
|hello |
|third world|
|second l|
||
||
|-- notes (modified) -- L|
||
cursor 5 1
== C-x C-q, not saved: refused
|hello |
|third world|
|second l|
||
||
|-- notes (modified) -- L|
|Not saved: C-x C-s saves|
cursor 5 1
asks: save
== C-x C-s, and the program says it wrote
|hello |
|third world|
|second l|
||
||
|-- notes -- L2 C5 ------|
|Wrote notes|
cursor 5 1
asks: quit
